    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d133-a5">

                <pb facs="0264" n="164" sameAs="frus:frus1880/pg164"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4 in No. 505.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">protocol.</hi></head>
                <p>The report of the committee upon the administration of justice having been this
                    day read before a general meeting of the representatives of treaty powers
                    assembled in Peking, it was agreed that the attention of the Chinese Government
                    should be immediately in vi ted to the propositions therein contained relating
                    to the mixed court at Shanghai, and that Mr. Seward, minister of the United
                    States, should be requested to prepare the draft of a collective note to the
                    Tsung-li Yamên for the purpose. It was further agreed that those propositions
                    which concern the larger question of the <pb facs="0265" n="165" xml:id="pg165"
                    /> administration of justice in general would be submitted to the several
                    governments represented at the conference, and that their instructions should be
                    solicited.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><date calendar="gregorian" when="1879-11-04"
                            >4th November, 1879</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>THOMAS FRANCIS WADE.</signed> (England.)<lb/><signed>M. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">v</hi>. BRANDT</signed>.
                        (Germany.)<lb/><signed>GEORGE F. SEWARD</signed>. (United
                        States.)<lb/><signed>J. H. FERGUSON</signed>. (Netherlands.)<lb/><signed>J.
                        F. ELMORE</signed>. (Peru.)<lb/><signed>FERD. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >de</hi> LUCA</signed>. (Italy.)<lb/><signed>HOFFER <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">de</hi> HOFFENFELS</signed>.
                        (Austria-Hungary.)<lb/><signed>A. KOYANDER</signed>.
                        (Russia.)<lb/><signed>RAMON GUTIERREZ <hi rendition="#small-caps">y</hi>
                        OSSA</signed>. (Spain.)<lb/><signed>PATENÔTRE</signed>.
                        (France.)<lb/><signed>HUB. SERRUYS</signed>. (Belgium.)</closer>
